<h1 class="display">Discreet, by design.</h1>
<div class="rule"></div>
<p class="lead">Bal Harbour is small, quiet, and easy to overstate. Onyx keeps arrivals the same way: on time, unmarked, and without a fuss at the entrance.</p>
<div class="page-actions">
<a class="btn btn-light" href="tel:+17869316699">Call now</a>
<a class="btn btn-ghost" href="contact.html#book">Request a quote</a>
</div>
<p class="trust-line">+1 786 931 ONYX (6699) · Licensed &amp; insured · Miami-Dade Permit #64666 · D-U-N-S&reg; 13-860-0693</p>
</div>
